	(text "SCHMITT TRIGGER: Q1 (gate X) and Q2 (gate = Q1's drain) share RS = 1k.  Q2 on: source at 0.45 V (RD2 10k); Q1 on: source at 0.1 V (RD1 47k).  VD2, Q2's drain, is the output: 0.5 V with X low, 5 V with X high."
